          "citation": "PMID 24986916",
          "claim": "To assess membrane localization of KCNH7 subunits, the V5 epitope tag (GKPIPNPLLGLDST) was inserted between amino acids 441 and 442 of the S1-S2 extracellular loop of KCNH7 and indirect immunofluorescence labeling was performed under non-permeabilizing conditions."
